## 5. Chunk filtering (junk policy)

**C1: Exhibit lists and boilerplate are not embedded** · Status: By design
5,717 chunks are left out of the index: exhibit lists (4,886) and empty boilerplate lines such as "See accompanying notes" (831). Signatures, powers of attorney and short chunks are kept, because they contain names and some real figures. Questions about which documents were filed as exhibits cannot be answered. `build_embeddings.py --keep-junk` puts them back.

**C2: Navigation clutter is excluded at query time** · Status: By design (switchable)
2,176 of 240,919 vectors (tables of contents, page-number lists, exhibit-list leftovers, XBRL / Exhibit 101 lists) are excluded from search by the retriever's clutter rule (`FEATURES["clutter"]`).

